Artifacts Evaluated - Functional
--------------------------------

CLIR is packaged in a self-contained Docker image and includes the source,
preprocessed IR corpus, architecture profiles, pinned Rust toolchain, automated
database initialization, a smoke test, output validation, and documented
reduced and full generation procedures.

Artifacts Evaluated - Reusable
-------------------------------

The artifact exposes target-specific and compatible generation as separate
commands, keeps architecture behavior in editable TOML profiles, documents the
repository layout and output format, includes direct CLI and interactive-shell
workflows, and provides a validator that can be reused for custom runs.

